    <string name="native_feedback_summary">Automatic pauses the extra controller audio/HD haptics on poor connections, high latency or stream bitrates below 12 Mbps. It resumes after 20 stable seconds. Requires the matching Apollo host. Buttons, ordinary rumble and adaptive triggers continue.</string>
